    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/20acf2e7c1daa52c92a43a74b59acd66.poster.avif?t=1753262686\" width=480 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/20acf2e7c1daa52c92a43a74b59acd66.webm?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/20acf2e7c1daa52c92a43a74b59acd66.mp4?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Another\u00a0action-packed crime romp from the infamous PAKO series!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAKO 4 is an atmospheric and violent indie action game where the player causes chaos in a big city by committing crimes with his accomplice and escaping the police. You can move around the city on foot or by car. Fast-paced arcade mechanics from PAKO 2 meet more in depth missions varying from escorting people to doing all kinds of hi-jinx around the North Paw area! Come and enjoy the old school feel of doing crimes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/fbb821ead7c6ef17fc700b70f8759d37.poster.avif?t=1753262686\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/fbb821ead7c6ef17fc700b70f8759d37.webm?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/fbb821ead7c6ef17fc700b70f8759d37.mp4?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player action game: drive and walk freely around in the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete various missions, such as bank robberies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired graphics of the early 2000s games we all loved!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with an npc buddy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your car breaks down, keep escaping on foot and take another: every car is drivable!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot twin-stick style and destroy stuff!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game radio channels bringing the bangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take screenshots in Photo Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/ce8f6ba11c1ff159ce8211f94ea95c0e.poster.webp?t=1753262686\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/ce8f6ba11c1ff159ce8211f94ea95c0e.webp?t=1753262686\" class=\"bb_img\" width=320 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features coming during Early Access! We encourage people to give their feedback, ideas and just generally talk stuff at the Community Hub, we are eager to listen what you are wishing for!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/20acf2e7c1daa52c92a43a74b59acd66.poster.avif?t=1753262686\" width=480 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/20acf2e7c1daa52c92a43a74b59acd66.webm?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/20acf2e7c1daa52c92a43a74b59acd66.mp4?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Another\u00a0action-packed crime romp from the infamous PAKO series!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAKO 4 is an atmospheric and violent indie action game where the player causes chaos in a big city by committing crimes with his accomplice and escaping the police. You can move around the city on foot or by car. Fast-paced arcade mechanics from PAKO 2 meet more in depth missions varying from escorting people to doing all kinds of hi-jinx around the North Paw area! Come and enjoy the old school feel of doing crimes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/fbb821ead7c6ef17fc700b70f8759d37.poster.avif?t=1753262686\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/fbb821ead7c6ef17fc700b70f8759d37.webm?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/fbb821ead7c6ef17fc700b70f8759d37.mp4?t=1753262686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player action game: drive and walk freely around in the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete various missions, such as bank robberies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired graphics of the early 2000s games we all loved!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with an npc buddy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your car breaks down, keep escaping on foot and take another: every car is drivable!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot twin-stick style and destroy stuff!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game radio channels bringing the bangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take screenshots in Photo Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/ce8f6ba11c1ff159ce8211f94ea95c0e.poster.webp?t=1753262686\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/ce8f6ba11c1ff159ce8211f94ea95c0e.webp?t=1753262686\" class=\"bb_img\" width=320 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features coming during Early Access! We encourage people to give their feedback, ideas and just generally talk stuff at the Community Hub, we are eager to listen what you are wishing for!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
